      "jp": "ある日の朝。拠点の近くを散歩していた僕は、\n泣きながら走ってゆくスゥノの姿を見かけた。",
      "jp_sha256": "c3d8100d46450b1d8861e4f6f8f1c3f776caee80963713e15a086f4686276ce9",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "어느 날 아침. 거점 근처를 산책하던 나는\n울면서 달려가는 스우노의 모습을 보았다.",
      "message_index_0based": 0,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 8,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b003-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "6997e0617b0fe6fd35dd36cd186a12a7e4fb20fd53aa086d8612ff0c39720173:000002_1292285113021570937:g0:r7",
      "row_index_0based": 7,
      "serialized_row_index": 7,
