        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "ある日の朝。拠点の近くを散歩していた僕は、\n泣きながら走ってゆくスゥノの姿を見かけた。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "a615abbe24bd47d28255e36fa43d07c38ebc6d429a342dd07964e57d3387856e",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 1,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "うぅ……スゥノは役に立たないんだ……。\nぐずっ……うわぁぁんっ！",
      "jp_sha256": "5cdd01dcbc79732113ad9fad1e71eee9b3220db07a2d7bfe2ab99e1b9ec015cf",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "으으…… 스우노는 쓸모가 없어…….\n훌쩍…… 우아아앙!",
      "message_index_0based": 1,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 9,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b003-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "6997e0617b0fe6fd35dd36cd186a12a7e4fb20fd53aa086d8612ff0c39720173:000002_1292285113021570937:g0:r8",
      "row_index_0based": 8,
      "serialized_row_index": 8,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "スゥノ",
        "Emt10_Sad",
        "layer_中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "うぅ……スゥノは役に立たないんだ……。\nぐずっ……うわぁぁんっ！",
        "",
        "ch_10053/R18/10053B0_10053_Nml/10053B0_10053_001",
        ""
      ],
      "speaker": "スゥノ",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": "ch_10053/R18/10053B0_10053_Nml/10053B0_10053_001"
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "bec456a0a4e2e4eecc3551977815887b787ab2cfa9a50865a9429dc1b322edf1",
