      "grid_message_index_0based": 2,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "彼女が来た方を見ると、\nモンスター娘たちが困った様子で顔を見合わせている。\n状況を理解するため、僕は彼女たちに話しかけることにした。",
      "jp_sha256": "5e0f000cbae421a66c2c5b9d5c00a3069085266877b78996f826a1ebe9ca7730",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "그녀가 온 쪽을 보니\n몬스터 소녀들이 곤란한 듯 서로의 얼굴을 보고 있었다.\n상황을 파악하기 위해 나는 그녀들에게 말을 걸기로 했다.",
      "message_index_0based": 2,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 15,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b003-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "6997e0617b0fe6fd35dd36cd186a12a7e4fb20fd53aa086d8612ff0c39720173:000002_1292285113021570937:g0:r14",
      "row_index_0based": 14,
      "serialized_row_index": 14,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "彼女が来た方を見ると、\nモンスター娘たちが困った様子で顔を見合わせている。\n状況を理解するため、僕は彼女たちに話しかけることにした。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "aa563df66376ce9524bcb019ae735cf426aa241031b21b709ac671674e5ac8df",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 3,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "どうしたんですか、エテジアさん。\nスゥノが走って行ってしまいましたけど……。",
      "jp_sha256": "93832b9800875d6921072e489716b9ed8f3675b7b2b5c69155b63a53d361c137",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "무슨 일이에요, 에테지아 씨.\n스우노가 달려가 버렸는데…….",
      "message_index_0based": 3,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 18,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b003-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "6997e0617b0fe6fd35dd36cd186a12a7e4fb20fd53aa086d8612ff0c39720173:000002_1292285113021570937:g0:r17",
      "row_index_0based": 17,
      "serialized_row_index": 17,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "どうしたんですか、エテジアさん。\nスゥノが走って行ってしまいましたけど……。"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "6eacee3358db41a12b5cbe28ba7ef14f695f06a7eb0ccc5a7c93e2e7dce4518d",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 4,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "あ、ご主人さま……。\n実は私たちで洗濯や倉庫整理などの仕事をしていたのだけど、\nスゥノが手伝いたいとやってきて……。",
      "jp_sha256": "3028c3978aa82a21d6f73cced46ba160e4853c122e64885fe556abab1eb98dbc",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "아, 주인님…….\n사실 우리끼리 빨래나 창고 정리 같은 일을 하고 있었는데\n스우노가 돕고 싶다며 찾아와서…….",
      "message_index_0based": 4,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 19,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b003-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "6997e0617b0fe6fd35dd36cd186a12a7e4fb20fd53aa086d8612ff0c39720173:000002_1292285113021570937:g0:r18",
      "row_index_0based": 18,
      "serialized_row_index": 18,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "エテジア",
        "Emt10_Sad",
        "layer_左中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "あ、ご主人さま……。\n実は私たちで洗濯や倉庫整理などの仕事をしていたのだけど、\nスゥノが手伝いたいとやってきて……。",
        "",
        "ch_10001/R18/10053B0_10001_Nml/10053B0_10001_002",
        ""
      ],
      "speaker": "エテジア",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": "ch_10001/R18/10053B0_10001_Nml/10053B0_10001_002"
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "dfe59c488069d602e9195a68b5b7b44297e8a93d376d6434aa9d7c117ae8f4fb",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 5,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "嬉しい申し出だったけど、もう分担は決まっていたし、\nスゥノちゃんには難しいか、力が足りない仕事ばかりなの。\nだから「ここはいいから遊んでおいで」って言ってしまって。",
      "jp_sha256": "12b008a202a387540bbd769147ae282b4e35b07e25dc5671664f10d6bf56b0c2",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "고마운 제안이었지만 이미 역할 분담은 정해져 있었고\n스우노에게는 어렵거나 힘이 모자라는 일뿐이었어.\n그래서 「여긴 괜찮으니 놀고 오렴」이라고 해 버려서.",
      "message_index_0based": 5,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 20,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b003-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "6997e0617b0fe6fd35dd36cd186a12a7e4fb20fd53aa086d8612ff0c39720173:000002_1292285113021570937:g0:r19",
      "row_index_0based": 19,
      "serialized_row_index": 19,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "ミィマ",
        "Emt10_Sad",
        "layer_右中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "嬉しい申し出だったけど、もう分担は決まっていたし、\nスゥノちゃんには難しいか、力が足りない仕事ばかりなの。\nだから「ここはいいから遊んでおいで」って言ってしまって。",
        "",
        "ch_10055/R18/10053B0_10055_Nml/10053B0_10055_003",
        ""
      ],
      "speaker": "ミィマ",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": "ch_10055/R18/10053B0_10055_Nml/10053B0_10055_003"
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "98afae133b09435b23315260faa7e76b9dda4fa8ac3de5a023f00de17b5bb265",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 6,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "なるほど。皆はスゥノを気遣ったのだけど、\nそれが逆効果になったというわけだ。\n誰が悪いということもない、ちょっとしたすれ違いである。",
      "jp_sha256": "7daad3c0898b390a886b0aebf64b544da83c191eaa7786001570bf817a6ae4f6",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "그렇구나. 다들 스우노를 배려한 것이지만\n그게 오히려 역효과가 난 셈이다.\n누가 잘못한 것도 아닌 작은 엇갈림이었다.",
      "message_index_0based": 6,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 21,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b003-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "6997e0617b0fe6fd35dd36cd186a12a7e4fb20fd53aa086d8612ff0c39720173:000002_1292285113021570937:g0:r20",
      "row_index_0based": 20,
      "serialized_row_index": 20,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "なるほど。皆はスゥノを気遣ったのだけど、\nそれが逆効果になったというわけだ。\n誰が悪いということもない、ちょっとしたすれ違いである。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "7300ff1d4e2ae517004863132c2256e13ca5930c309f5bcee60385b797eab87c",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 7,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "状況は理解しました。\nスゥノは僕が探して、話をしてみます。\n皆さんは仕事を続けてください！",
      "jp_sha256": "f78101cbe4da17c3f11f1311664e8b3536350420a6c5b7d6f507824c19efa90d",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "상황은 알겠어요.\n스우노는 제가 찾아서 이야기해 볼게요.\n여러분은 일을 계속해 주세요!",
      "message_index_0based": 7,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 22,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b003-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "6997e0617b0fe6fd35dd36cd186a12a7e4fb20fd53aa086d8612ff0c39720173:000002_1292285113021570937:g0:r21",
      "row_index_0based": 21,
      "serialized_row_index": 21,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "状況は理解しました。\nスゥノは僕が探して、話をしてみます。\n皆さんは仕事を続けてください！"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "5ad9f0fef8173af70b4155c2b08ba7a3056c0b3c82785f807e9f0df2e7c88415",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 8,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "そうね……ここはご主人さまに任せた方がよさそう。\nスゥノ、最近やけにお手伝いを頑張ってくれているの。\nそれにはちゃんと感謝しているって、伝えてくれないかしら。",
      "jp_sha256": "109ef8e1ca8a72e199fa0c057a99688ecf59293a3a5398d8baa6328f37ac4f2e",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "그래…… 이건 주인님에게 맡기는 편이 좋겠네.\n스우노, 요즘 유난히 열심히 도와주고 있어.\n그 점은 정말 고맙게 생각한다고 전해 주지 않을래?",
      "message_index_0based": 8,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 24,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b003-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "6997e0617b0fe6fd35dd36cd186a12a7e4fb20fd53aa086d8612ff0c39720173:000002_1292285113021570937:g0:r23",
      "row_index_0based": 23,
      "serialized_row_index": 23,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "エテジア",
        "Emt3_Gla",
        "layer_左中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "そうね……ここはご主人さまに任せた方がよさそう。\nスゥノ、最近やけにお手伝いを頑張ってくれているの。\nそれにはちゃんと感謝しているって、伝えてくれないかしら。",
        "",
        "ch_10001/R18/10053B0_10001_Nml/10053B0_10001_004",
